# Dev: no SOCKS proxy. The VPN server and its microsocks egress proxy went away
# in #281, and with them the proxied http_2xx_ext / http_synapse_ext modules —
# only the direct modules in values/blackbox-exporter.yaml exist. Dev runs
# ingress-nginx with PROXY protocol on and DNS-only tenant records, so a pod
# probing a tenant's public host is short-circuited past the NodeBalancer and
# rejected; create_env therefore skips the public-endpoint Probes on such envs
# (loudly) and deploys the internal ones only. Public reachability on dev is
# covered by scripts/verify-endpoints at the end of every deploy.
{}
